<title>NEW ZEALAND: St Lukes buys ChCh shopping centre.</title>
<headline>St Lukes buys ChCh shopping centre.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>St Lukes Group Ltd said on Tuesday it had bought Riccarton shopping centre in Christchurch from the joint venture companies associated with Prudential Corporation NZ and Prudential Corporation Australia, for NZ$113 million.</p>
</text>
